leaving the room!\n\n- Explorers looking for a relaxing, non-game escape\n- Fans of nostalgia, atmospheric immersion, or ambient worlds\n- Apartment dwellers wanting something personal and transformative\n\nThis Mixed Reality experience blends your physical environment with immersive transformation like a **4D movie experience, mesmerizing gameplay, and intuitive interactive artifacts.**  \n \n# FEATURES:\n\n\ud83d\udcf7 Real-world photo import: Capture your space and personalize your MR experience (MR and VR) \n\n\ud83c\udf0c Seamless transformation via scene understanding: walls, furniture, and lighting\n\n\ud83d\udd0d Interactive \u201crelics\u201d that spark ambient sounds, animations, or memories\n\n\ud83c\udf08 Multiple themes starting with space, underwater, and cabin retreat. \n\n{919666410929775}\n\n# VENTURE INTO YOUR PSACE LIKE NEVER BEFORE\n\n- Bring your world into the experience, and reshape it into something wonderful\n- Snap a picture of your real space and import it into the app to shape how the MR elements adapt and react. Every environment becomes yours uniquely.\n\n{1658328865167768}\n\n\ud83d\udd17 https://discord.gg/9dxeBtEJUt\n\n# \ud83d\ude80 New worlds and customizations are added regularly!\n", "short_description": "Escape the ordinary. Transform your space into a living world."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/jimmyd95/In-Wonder-Privacy-Policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "XR Capsules", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.xrcapsules.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphi